scenario a cloudier live answer after the 5 s cap, before the hand-over, still tightens B
# The cache (2 h old, C = 0.958) is resolved at the cap. The live answer
# arrives at 6 s, while the needle shows the sky; it is cloudier (synthetic
# body, every sample 100%), so tighten-only takes it.
net late
cache fresh
boot
wait 5.5
expect source == CACHED        # resolved at the cap from the cache
expect budget_set == 0
within 3 budget_set == 1
expect source == LIVE
expect sky_c == 1
expect budget < 20.1           # B_max / 3, below the cached night's 20.5
